---
module: protocols
func_id: list-protocols
---

***conformance tests***

# questions-red-flags-first
In every :Protocol: of `listProtocols()`, no `RED_FLAG` question comes after a `SYMPTOM` or `MEASUREMENT` one, and no `SYMPTOM` after a `MEASUREMENT` one; the cardiac surgery :Protocol: has the question `weightKg` of `kind` `MEASUREMENT` with `unit` `kg`.
